          "section": "4. Conclusions",
          "quote": "The superior thermal stability of FeCrAl-ZrC could be understood by the Zener pinning mechanism [27,28], because the nanoparticles prevent the motion of grain boundaries by exerting a pinning pressure which counteracts the driving force pushing the boundaries.",
